                                "sense_id": "4ac65aea-ed65-3eee-acef-627eba68a261",
                                "text": "Canada has continued to work within this agency to promote a multilateral solution to the problems of narcotrafficking and narcoterrorism."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e165eb2d-9816-4979-80c8-b381fc09ac6e",
                                "sense_id": "4ac65aea-ed65-3eee-acef-627eba68a261",
                                "text": "That is a sore point for the U.S. President Trump. He has in the past spoken against multilateral trade agreements. He argued that the deals give too much advantage to America's trading partners and lead to job losses in the U.S."
                            }
                        ]
